    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our best games</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c6b558a5009dc96ed10021b3de2ee8e2.poster.avif?t=1716975524\" width=610 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c6b558a5009dc96ed10021b3de2ee8e2.webm?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c6b558a5009dc96ed10021b3de2ee8e2.mp4?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Switch Range is a dynamic game that will transport you to a world of intense clashes, where you will become a fearless defender of the base against the relentless onslaught of robots. <br><br><strong>The player's task is to effectively repel waves of enemy robots, utilizing tactics and marksmanship skills. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/81ff65c8961fafad36f8e3ee897795d6.poster.avif?t=1716975524\" width=610 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/81ff65c8961fafad36f8e3ee897795d6.webm?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/81ff65c8961fafad36f8e3ee897795d6.mp4?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game requires the player to adapt to the changing situation on the battlefield. The realistic behavior of projectiles adds an additional challenge, allowing the player to carefully plan shots and aim precisely. These are key elements for success in defending the base against increasingly advanced and numerous waves of robots. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c66d3d15630815c98c0296e4b8ebc7ca.poster.avif?t=1716975524\" width=610 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c66d3d15630815c98c0296e4b8ebc7ca.webm?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c66d3d15630815c98c0296e4b8ebc7ca.mp4?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Will you be able to maintain the base in the face of endless attacks?</strong> Discover the secrets of this dynamic game and find out if you have what it takes to become an unbeatable defender in Switch Range!",
    "about_the_game": "<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c6b558a5009dc96ed10021b3de2ee8e2.poster.avif?t=1716975524\" width=610 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c6b558a5009dc96ed10021b3de2ee8e2.webm?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c6b558a5009dc96ed10021b3de2ee8e2.mp4?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Switch Range is a dynamic game that will transport you to a world of intense clashes, where you will become a fearless defender of the base against the relentless onslaught of robots. <br><br><strong>The player's task is to effectively repel waves of enemy robots, utilizing tactics and marksmanship skills. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/81ff65c8961fafad36f8e3ee897795d6.poster.avif?t=1716975524\" width=610 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/81ff65c8961fafad36f8e3ee897795d6.webm?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/81ff65c8961fafad36f8e3ee897795d6.mp4?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game requires the player to adapt to the changing situation on the battlefield. The realistic behavior of projectiles adds an additional challenge, allowing the player to carefully plan shots and aim precisely. These are key elements for success in defending the base against increasingly advanced and numerous waves of robots. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c66d3d15630815c98c0296e4b8ebc7ca.poster.avif?t=1716975524\" width=610 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c66d3d15630815c98c0296e4b8ebc7ca.webm?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958170/extras/c66d3d15630815c98c0296e4b8ebc7ca.mp4?t=1716975524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Will you be able to maintain the base in the face of endless attacks?</strong> Discover the secrets of this dynamic game and find out if you have what it takes to become an unbeatable defender in Switch Range!",
